# Vice Fleet Admiral  

  

## Overview  

  

Vice Fleet Admiral is the second-highest rank within Eagle Fleet and serves directly beneath the Fleet Admiral. Officers holding this rank are responsible for supporting the Fleet Admiral in the administration, coordination, and strategic direction of the fleet.  

  

Vice Fleet Admirals may act on behalf of the Fleet Admiral when delegated and are frequently entrusted with the oversight of major commands, departments, and operational initiatives.  

  

## Rank Information  

  

| Category | Value |  

|----------|--------|  

| Rank | Vice Fleet Admiral |  

| Abbreviation | VFADM |  

| Grade | Flag Officer |  

| Superior Rank | [[00 Fleet Admiral]] |  

| Junior Rank | [[02 Admiral]] |  

| Typical Posting | Fleet Headquarters, Admiralty Staff |  

  

## Responsibilities  

  

- Assisting the Fleet Admiral in fleet leadership  

- Coordinating fleet-wide operations and activities  

- Supervising Admiralty departments  

- Managing strategic planning initiatives  

- Overseeing major exercises and deployments  

- Representing the Fleet Admiral when required  

  

## Authority  

  

A Vice Fleet Admiral possesses authority over all subordinate officers and enlisted personnel within assigned commands and may issue directives in accordance with Fleet regulations and the orders of the Fleet Admiral.  

  

## Typical Assignments  

  

- Deputy Commander, Eagle Fleet  

- Chief of Fleet Operations  

- Director of Strategic Planning  

- Senior Admiralty Staff Officer  

- Commander of a major fleet formation  

  

